 "words": 248,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The prophets watched through ages for the one the LORD would send",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A king to reign on David's throne whose peace would have no end",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then in the fields of Bethlehem the shepherds kept the night",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the glory of the Lord shone round them, a great and holy light",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people who walked in darkness have seen a great light",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "On those who lived in a land of deep shadow, light has dawned",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For to us a child is born, to us a son is given",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the government will rest on his shoulders",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his name shall be called Wonderful Counselor, Mighty God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everlasting Father, Prince of Peace",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He came to what was his own, and his own did not receive",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But to all who took him in, to all who would believe",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one through whom all things were made, the light of all mankind",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lay wrapped in cloths and in a manger, as the angel said they'd find",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For to us a child is born, to us a son is given",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the government will rest on his shoulders",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And his name shall be called Wonderful Counselor, Mighty God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everlasting Father, Prince of Peace",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the Word became flesh and made his dwelling among us",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And we have seen his glory",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Full of grace and truth",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Glory to God in the highest",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
